WEBVTT

00:17.540 --> 00:19.550
<i>A voice inside me says:</i>

00:19.630 --> 00:21.800
<i>The brain of Team Y</i>

00:21.880 --> 00:23.880
<i>is you, Niko!</i>

00:25.590 --> 00:27.850
We have the same eyes.

00:28.720 --> 00:30.810
But you can't defeat me.

00:32.680 --> 00:35.020
I'm the one controlling this match.

00:35.730 --> 00:38.360
<i>Wait and see, you bang-haired bastard.</i>

00:42.070 --> 00:43.230
15TH MINUTE OF THE 2ND HALF

00:43.390 --> 00:45.340
Let's attack and break them down!

00:48.580 --> 00:52.330
<i>Naruhaya's weapon is eluding the defense and getting behind them.</i>

00:52.410 --> 00:53.790
I won't allow it!

00:55.290 --> 00:56.380
Sorry, Naruhaya!

00:56.460 --> 00:57.830
Hell yeah! Nice!

00:57.920 --> 00:58.840
Press them!

00:58.920 --> 00:59.800
Get the ball back!

00:59.880 --> 01:01.630
-Pass it here!
-We're on you, Niko!

01:03.050 --> 01:05.920
I'll cut off your path and intercept every pass meant for you!

01:06.390 --> 01:08.430
You annoying bastard.

01:08.510 --> 01:10.100
I'll make the opening.

01:10.180 --> 01:11.470
Let's try again!

01:11.560 --> 01:14.020
Hey, Isagi! It's time to use your weapon!

01:14.100 --> 01:16.940
That's good! Keep going with the Naruhaya formation!

01:18.480 --> 01:19.610
Are you sure?

01:19.690 --> 01:20.690
Yes!

01:20.890 --> 01:23.360
Rather than pushing up and disrupting the balance,

01:23.440 --> 01:26.860
<i>stopping him here will increase our chances of scoring.</i>

01:28.030 --> 01:32.120
You all heard him too, right? Ego's words, 'Arm yourselves'.

01:33.330 --> 01:34.620
So what?

01:35.210 --> 01:37.000
That's when I started thinking.

01:37.750 --> 01:40.340
'What is my weapon?'

01:40.420 --> 01:42.860
-Gagamaru, yours!
-Everyone in Blue Lock is extremely talented.

01:42.910 --> 01:45.630
Extremely talented.

01:45.720 --> 01:49.550
When it comes to shooting, I can't beat Okawa.

01:49.640 --> 01:52.760
But I can't lose.

01:52.850 --> 01:56.960
I can't run fast, and I don't have a strong physique!

01:56.990 --> 01:59.900
The weapons I need to survive in this place are

02:00.020 --> 02:02.730
these eyes that can analyze the field clearly

02:03.440 --> 02:06.190
and this superior intellect that allows me to coordinate others.

02:07.990 --> 02:11.530
You might manage to stop me, but never my ideas.

02:12.620 --> 02:13.870
<i>What the hell is he saying?</i>

02:14.920 --> 02:16.110
35TH MINUTE OF THE 2ND HALF

02:16.300 --> 02:19.470
Here we go! My weapon is never giving up!

02:19.550 --> 02:20.930
Amen!

02:21.040 --> 02:22.200
Don't lose the ball!

02:22.220 --> 02:23.640
-Dribble around them!
-Goddammit!

02:23.720 --> 02:26.520
All they're doing is passing the ball around!

02:26.760 --> 02:28.120
Do you want a draw?

02:28.440 --> 02:31.860
<i>I'm stopping the counter-attacks centered on Okawa that Niko is creating.</i>

02:31.940 --> 02:35.440
It's not that they're not attacking. They can't!

02:35.530 --> 02:37.780
Then it's our turn to attack! Push forward!

02:37.860 --> 02:39.860
If we score, we win! Finish them off!

02:39.950 --> 02:41.950
Time is running out! Get the ball!

02:42.660 --> 02:45.580
Final minute. It's about time.

02:45.660 --> 02:47.370
Our last resort.

02:48.080 --> 02:50.750
This is a kamikaze tactic we only use

02:50.830 --> 02:53.210
-when we're backed into a corner.
-Block the passing lanes!

02:53.290 --> 02:54.550
The signal is,

02:56.210 --> 02:59.630
Okawa taking the ball on his own.

03:00.340 --> 03:04.430
Rather than Okawa's isolated counters these 89 minutes,

03:04.510 --> 03:06.310
in the final minute,

03:06.390 --> 03:10.100
with the entire Team Y participating,

03:10.190 --> 03:12.560
'One-Time Death Counter!'

03:16.570 --> 03:18.440
<i>Damn it, we were tricked!</i>

03:19.360 --> 03:21.740
<i>Too many of us pushed forward.</i>

03:22.360 --> 03:24.030
<i>Our defense is wide open!</i>

03:24.120 --> 03:26.580
<i>If they score,</i>

03:27.330 --> 03:28.790
<i>we lose!</i>

03:29.500 --> 03:30.500
<i>No way!</i>

03:31.920 --> 03:32.920
<i>I...</i>

03:35.500 --> 03:36.550
Are you serious?

03:36.630 --> 03:37.760
-Stop him!
-Get back!

03:37.840 --> 03:39.090
Get back!

03:39.170 --> 03:41.130
We're screwed! Someone stop him!

03:41.220 --> 03:42.930
Last line of defense, we're on you!

03:48.220 --> 03:49.520
<i>One-on-one.</i>

03:49.600 --> 03:51.600
<i>If I can't stop him,</i>

03:51.690 --> 03:54.520
<i>my soccer career, our soccer careers, are over!</i>

03:55.360 --> 03:58.110
<i>No matter what, I'll stop him!</i>

04:03.860 --> 04:05.530
<i>Okawa?</i>

04:08.410 --> 04:09.580
<i>It's over!</i>

04:11.040 --> 04:12.370
<i>We're screwed.</i>

04:22.420 --> 04:24.680
You're here, right, Niko?

04:25.430 --> 04:29.010
This is where the scent of the goal is strongest.

04:31.640 --> 04:33.140
<i>You resemble me.</i>

04:33.770 --> 04:36.230
<i>We have the same eyes and the same thoughts.</i>

04:36.310 --> 04:38.940
<i>That's why, instead of shooting,</i>

04:39.020 --> 04:41.320
<i>you passed to Okawa to finish it.</i>

04:41.400 --> 04:42.860
I'm the winner, Niko.

04:43.360 --> 04:46.910
You, who chose to pass at the last moment,

04:46.990 --> 04:48.700
are a failure as a forward!

04:51.660 --> 04:53.790
Shit! They're on a counter-attack!

04:53.870 --> 04:56.290
Get the ball back!

04:56.960 --> 04:58.500
<i>Choosing to pass instead of shoot,</i>

04:59.420 --> 05:01.710
<i>I lost and cried.</i>

05:01.800 --> 05:04.050
<i>I don't need that version of me.</i>

05:05.010 --> 05:06.010
<i>I want to win!</i>

05:08.890 --> 05:11.220
<i>If I'm going to be reborn, now is the time!</i>

05:14.390 --> 05:15.520
You're amazing, Isagi!

05:16.600 --> 05:19.060
Even if you have to foul him, stop him!

05:19.150 --> 05:20.020
Damn it!

05:20.110 --> 05:21.480
Leaving it to you!

05:22.530 --> 05:24.150
Understood!

05:24.240 --> 05:25.700
-Stop him!
-Come on!

05:32.910 --> 05:34.790
<i>The rest is in their hands.</i>

05:36.920 --> 05:38.380
<i>So low. But</i>

05:38.460 --> 05:39.670
<i>I can reach it!</i>

05:41.210 --> 05:42.590
Oh crap! He missed it!

05:42.670 --> 05:43.510
No.

05:43.590 --> 05:45.510
My target is the one behind him,

05:48.010 --> 05:49.260
Number 11.

05:51.140 --> 05:52.560
What's he doing there?

05:52.640 --> 05:53.890
Go.

05:53.970 --> 05:56.390
Finish it, you egoist,

05:57.190 --> 05:58.440
Isagi Yoichi!

05:59.440 --> 06:02.650
<i>I am a striker!</i>

06:15.950 --> 06:17.540
<i>-Time's up.</i>
-Well done, Isagi!

06:17.620 --> 06:21.130
<i>-Blue Lock Building 5 Match 4, 2 - 1.</i>
-Hell yeah!

06:21.210 --> 06:22.560
<i>-Victory for Team Z.</i>
-Yes!

06:23.130 --> 06:25.090
Well done!

06:26.590 --> 06:28.800
You were amazing, man! What a goal!

06:28.880 --> 06:30.260
How much did you run?

06:31.350 --> 06:32.350
Where to?

06:42.020 --> 06:43.020
Damn it!

06:44.820 --> 06:46.240
<i>I destroyed them.</i>

06:47.190 --> 06:49.360
<i>The dreams of those 11 people,</i>

06:51.530 --> 06:52.870
<i>my goal destroyed them.</i>

06:58.620 --> 07:00.830
<i>Is this what winning is?</i>

07:09.630 --> 07:10.970
<i>What is this feeling?</i>

07:17.180 --> 07:19.020
<i>It's legendary!</i>

08:59.660 --> 09:04.250
To Team Z winning their second match, cheers!

09:04.330 --> 09:06.460
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

09:06.540 --> 09:07.880
-Great.
-Dig in, guys!

09:07.960 --> 09:10.130
Meat, after so long. It's delicious!

09:10.210 --> 09:12.340
The taste of victory is amazing!

09:13.550 --> 09:15.380
So delicious!

09:15.470 --> 09:19.100
Hey! That was the meat from Isagi's and my goal.

09:19.180 --> 09:21.640
We said we'd eat it together, leave some for us!

09:21.720 --> 09:22.980
-Nom!
-Hey!

09:23.060 --> 09:25.480
Spit it out! That's my share!

09:25.560 --> 09:29.480
Come on, everyone, we're all sharing our meals today.

09:29.570 --> 09:33.150
Since we're tasting different flavors today, don't fight.

09:33.240 --> 09:34.110
Wow!

09:34.190 --> 09:35.780
What are you, a grandma?

09:36.360 --> 09:37.410
Oh, there's gyoza too.

09:37.490 --> 09:38.490
There's mackerel too!

09:38.570 --> 09:40.740
Natto's not bad either.

09:40.830 --> 09:42.290
I have my pickled radish too!

09:42.370 --> 09:43.800
-Thanks, I'll pass.
-Thanks, I'll pass.

09:45.410 --> 09:48.670
Anyway, why did you run to that spot?

09:48.750 --> 09:50.170
Right.

09:50.250 --> 09:52.380
-Did you know the ball was coming?

09:52.460 --> 09:55.590
No, not exactly, but

09:56.170 --> 10:01.760
I ran to score a goal, and I thought the ball might come there.

10:01.850 --> 10:05.060
I saw you, Isagi. Well done!

10:05.140 --> 10:06.980
Thanks for the pass, Bachira.

10:07.060 --> 10:08.980
This is your reward. Say 'Ah'.

10:09.060 --> 10:11.150
I can feed myself, thanks.

10:11.230 --> 10:14.150
Don't be shy, take it. Hop, pass!

10:14.230 --> 10:18.070
Anyway, Isagi's weapon is smelling the 'scent' of a goal.

10:19.450 --> 10:21.780
Thanks to that, we won with Isagi's goal.

10:22.870 --> 10:23.990
These are the facts.

10:26.040 --> 10:27.870
I don't agree.

10:27.960 --> 10:30.330
Anyway, in the end, we won.

10:30.420 --> 10:33.210
We will definitely survive, Team Z!

10:33.300 --> 10:34.840
-Yeah!
-Yeah!

10:34.920 --> 10:35.780
More food!

10:35.840 --> 10:37.510
I have more space now.

10:37.590 --> 10:38.590
I want some too.

10:44.510 --> 10:48.350
I don't want any more pickled radish.

10:50.350 --> 10:52.230
<i>Ah, this really is pathetic!</i>

10:53.150 --> 10:54.070
<i>Anyway,</i>

10:54.150 --> 10:56.780
<i>I'm so excited I can't get a wink of sleep!</i>

10:59.660 --> 11:02.070
<i>We really did win thanks to me, didn't we?</i>

11:02.740 --> 11:04.370
<i>With my goal.</i>

11:05.240 --> 11:08.210
<i>'I' crushed them.</i>

11:09.080 --> 11:11.330
<i>It felt so good.</i>

11:12.130 --> 11:13.840
<i>I wonder what this feeling is called?</i>

11:14.500 --> 11:16.250
<i>I've experienced this for the first time.</i>

11:17.170 --> 11:20.680
<i>Or am I secretly a piece of shit?</i>

11:20.760 --> 11:22.340
<i>If so, that's bad.</i>

11:25.600 --> 11:27.520
BUILDING 5 - TEAM Z
MONITORING ROOM

11:29.810 --> 11:30.810
Chigiri.

11:31.400 --> 11:32.400
Is that you, Isagi?

11:33.110 --> 11:34.270
Why did you come here?

11:34.360 --> 11:38.650
I couldn't sleep, so I thought I'd take a look at the match replay.

11:38.740 --> 11:39.950
You?

11:40.030 --> 11:41.490
I couldn't sleep either.

11:42.240 --> 11:43.950
I watched your goal.

11:45.410 --> 11:49.080
It's normal not to be able to sleep after a goal like that.

11:50.000 --> 11:52.790
It's the best possible thing for a forward.

11:53.460 --> 11:55.840
Yeah, how should I put it?

11:55.920 --> 12:00.470
It was an impossible goal for the me before coming to Blue Lock.

12:01.800 --> 12:05.350
I probably won't forget this goal for the rest of my life.

12:07.140 --> 12:10.390
But I don't think I can do it again.

12:10.480 --> 12:12.350
I just ran without thinking.

12:14.520 --> 12:18.730
You probably have high spatial awareness.

12:19.530 --> 12:20.530
What's that?

12:21.150 --> 12:23.200
Many players

12:23.280 --> 12:27.200
<i>make decisions and play based only on their own field of vision.</i>

12:27.780 --> 12:34.670
<i>This field of vision narrows even more when running fast or dribbling.</i>

12:34.750 --> 12:36.710
<i>But you,</i>

12:36.790 --> 12:39.420
<i>there's a moment when you play</i>

12:39.500 --> 12:41.840
<i>as if you've mastered the entire field.</i>

12:42.880 --> 12:46.720
To give an example, it's like a god watching from the sky.

12:48.100 --> 12:52.890
This talent allows you to smell the scent of goals, prevent crises,

12:52.980 --> 12:56.400
<i>and score goals no one could foresee.</i>

12:57.060 --> 12:59.020
The talent of spatial awareness.

13:00.030 --> 13:01.650
Is that my weapon?

13:02.900 --> 13:05.570
Even if you're still doing it through intuition,

13:05.660 --> 13:08.490
once you master this talent,

13:09.410 --> 13:12.370
your eyes and brain will become your sole weapons.

13:13.370 --> 13:15.500
At least, that's what I think.

13:18.290 --> 13:21.670
I see. Thanks, Chigiri.

13:21.740 --> 13:24.190
I feel like you've given me a great clue.

13:24.260 --> 13:27.180
Despite always looking scary, you're a good guy.

13:27.260 --> 13:28.180
Not really.

13:28.260 --> 13:30.930
I'm saying this so we can win.

13:31.010 --> 13:33.680
By the way, what's your weapon?

13:33.770 --> 13:35.640
You didn't tell us last time either.

13:37.150 --> 13:39.900
I said it then too, I don't want to say it.

13:39.980 --> 13:42.440
But why? Come on, tell me!

13:42.530 --> 13:44.900
I'll help as much as I can.

13:44.990 --> 13:46.910
I want to get to know you.

13:48.530 --> 13:50.030
I told you, forget it.

13:50.120 --> 13:51.370
There's nothing more to know about me...

13:51.450 --> 13:53.750
No. It's important, isn't it?

14:00.590 --> 14:03.760
Anterior cruciate ligament tear.

14:03.840 --> 14:07.510
I got injured a year ago.

14:09.930 --> 14:13.600
The doctor said if I injure the same place again,

14:13.680 --> 14:15.980
it would be dangerous for me to play.

14:17.640 --> 14:20.610
I had it too, Isagi.

14:20.690 --> 14:23.020
Nights when I couldn't sleep from the excitement of a goal I scored,

14:24.150 --> 14:27.700
<i>alongside a magnificent weapon like yours.</i>

14:27.780 --> 14:30.740
<i>There were times I believed I'd become the world's best striker.</i>

14:32.120 --> 14:36.410
But even though I've healed, I'm afraid of getting injured again.

14:37.080 --> 14:39.080
I'm afraid of losing this amazing game,

14:39.170 --> 14:41.170
losing my dreams.

14:41.960 --> 14:46.050
I came here to find something that would make me give up on my dream.

14:47.840 --> 14:49.010
Isagi,

14:49.090 --> 14:53.390
when I saw your goal, I felt like I might be able to give up.

14:56.100 --> 14:57.090
Quit the lies, Chigiri.

14:58.440 --> 15:00.400
Don't put the blame on me.

15:01.020 --> 15:03.360
You don't actually want to give up, do you?

15:03.440 --> 15:05.190
Same goes for me.

15:05.280 --> 15:08.820
I'm fighting because I'm scared, because I don't want it to end.

15:09.530 --> 15:12.030
If you haven't prepared yourself to give up everything,

15:12.120 --> 15:14.410
there's no way your dream will come true!

15:16.330 --> 15:19.080
What do you know about me?

15:24.590 --> 15:28.670
It's about time to report to the JFU.

15:28.760 --> 15:30.340
What shall we do,

15:31.130 --> 15:32.340
Ego-san?

15:33.800 --> 15:36.060
Wait a bit, Anri-chan.

15:37.390 --> 15:40.020
I'm having my enjoyment time right now.

15:40.100 --> 15:44.480
You really love it, Ego-san. Do you eat anything else?

15:44.560 --> 15:46.070
Don't exaggerate.

15:46.150 --> 15:49.440
Since I couldn't eat it during my playing days,

15:49.530 --> 15:51.740
I'm only eating these right now.

15:51.820 --> 15:56.990
At least tidy up your own dishes!

15:57.080 --> 15:59.870
There's no need for me to do things others can do.

15:59.960 --> 16:03.790
Also, it's in my contract that I do nothing but soccer, right?

16:05.130 --> 16:09.130
Anyway, how is the first Blue Lock selection going?

16:09.210 --> 16:11.340
Yeah, it's going.

16:11.930 --> 16:15.350
Just watch. Things are about to heat up now.

16:19.100 --> 16:21.390
You missed and it's over, Isagi.

16:21.480 --> 16:22.600
You're pathetic.

16:23.140 --> 16:25.060
That goal was just luck, right?

16:25.150 --> 16:27.320
Come on, come on, continue training.

16:31.190 --> 16:32.490
Damn it.

16:32.590 --> 16:33.740
Here we go! I'm here!

16:33.800 --> 16:34.910
A little faster!

16:35.660 --> 16:38.950
<i>Everyone except me is doing just fine.</i>

16:39.040 --> 16:40.580
<i>Their endurance is a separate issue.</i>

16:42.370 --> 16:44.580
<i>My weapon is smelling the scent of goals.</i>

16:44.670 --> 16:47.130
<i>I know it's spatial awareness, but</i>

16:47.960 --> 16:51.670
<i>I still don't know how to use it.</i>

16:54.550 --> 16:57.510
What do you know about me?

16:58.300 --> 17:01.220
<i>I angered Chigiri with careless words.</i>

17:01.310 --> 17:03.640
<i>I'm also a burden to everyone in training.</i>

17:04.440 --> 17:06.480
<i>I can't continue like this.</i>

17:08.060 --> 17:11.570
I don't want this to end as 'a lucky goal'.

17:12.610 --> 17:14.990
<i>Greetings, diamonds in the rough.</i>

17:16.280 --> 17:19.660
<i>Mayonnaise and sauce really do go well together.</i>

17:19.740 --> 17:20.580
Ego.

17:20.660 --> 17:21.870
<i>It looks so delicious!</i>

17:21.950 --> 17:22.910
<i>Delicious.</i>

17:23.000 --> 17:23.830
<i>Very delicious.</i>

17:23.910 --> 17:27.790
As of right now, the 6th match has concluded.

17:27.880 --> 17:29.750
Here are the results and standings.

17:29.840 --> 17:30.880
Bam!

17:32.170 --> 17:34.510
Three teams are on the verge of elimination?

17:34.590 --> 17:36.720
Team V has pulled away!

17:36.800 --> 17:40.390
That means if we don't win our next match against Team W,

17:40.470 --> 17:41.470
we're screwed.

17:42.930 --> 17:44.390
Things are heating up now.

17:44.980 --> 17:48.230
Your player rankings will now be determined based on your performance

17:48.310 --> 17:51.020
and achievements so far.

17:51.940 --> 17:56.820
<i>Those worthy of being forwards must prove themselves with their goals.</i>

17:56.910 --> 18:01.120
<i>The more valuable your goals, the higher your ranking will rise.</i>

18:01.200 --> 18:04.410
<i>So, right now, Team Z's best player</i>

18:04.500 --> 18:06.120
<i>is you,</i>

18:06.870 --> 18:08.330
<i>Isagi Yoichi.</i>

18:11.920 --> 18:15.670
<i>I'm Team Z's best player?</i>

18:16.340 --> 18:17.430
Bastard.

18:17.510 --> 18:21.470
<i>Finding your weapon is the first rule of being a forward.</i>

18:21.550 --> 18:25.060
<i>The next step is refining that weapon of yours.</i>

18:28.060 --> 18:29.520
Unleash its power.

18:30.270 --> 18:32.770
<i>Let's take Argentina's famous forward,</i>

18:32.860 --> 18:34.530
<i>Lionel Messi, for example.</i>

18:34.610 --> 18:38.990
<i>His weapons are his quick and elegant dribbling, and</i>

18:39.070 --> 18:42.120
<i>incredibly fast left-footed shots.</i>

18:42.200 --> 18:46.450
<i>In this respect, he's one of the most prominent figures in the world.</i>

18:46.540 --> 18:50.750
That's why he continues to be one of the best.

18:50.830 --> 18:53.670
Everyone's weapons are different.

18:53.750 --> 18:57.260
Therefore, how you polish them varies from person to person.

18:57.340 --> 19:00.470
You can't become something by imitating Messi.

19:01.510 --> 19:07.930
<i>How can you develop your weapon that can turn zero into one?</i>

19:08.020 --> 19:11.060
<i>Discover and bring out your own playing style.</i>

19:11.730 --> 19:15.940
<i>The gem called talent, if left unpolished,</i>

19:16.030 --> 19:17.360
<i>is no different from trash.</i>

19:17.440 --> 19:18.820
MATCH 7
START TIME

19:18.900 --> 19:21.410
So our match is in 24 hours.

19:21.490 --> 19:24.280
We should watch Team W's match recording.

19:24.370 --> 19:26.830
Alright, let's call it a day here.

19:26.910 --> 19:30.000
Well done, guys.

19:30.080 --> 19:31.290
-Good!
-Well done!

19:31.370 --> 19:32.210
Okay.

19:32.290 --> 19:34.790
-Shower time!
-Food first!

19:35.710 --> 19:37.920
<i>'Unleash it,' he says.</i>

19:38.010 --> 19:40.010
<i>How can I polish it?</i>

19:40.840 --> 19:42.340
<i>Besides, my weapon</i>

19:42.930 --> 19:48.600
<i>isn't a classic thing like dribbling or shooting.</i>

19:49.230 --> 19:54.310
<i>I can't feel the 'scent of the goal' unless it comes to me.</i>

19:56.570 --> 19:59.240
<i>I don't know when that moment will come, but</i>

19:59.990 --> 20:02.490
<i>it's meaningless if I'm exhausted.</i>

20:02.570 --> 20:03.620
<i>Right.</i>

20:03.700 --> 20:05.740
<i>What I need to develop</i>

20:05.830 --> 20:08.000
<i>is a physique that lets me stay in form for the full 90 minutes</i>

20:08.000 --> 20:11.040
<i>so I'm ready when that moment comes.</i>

20:11.040 --> 20:13.670
<i>I'll definitely win. I'll unleash that power!</i>

20:16.380 --> 20:18.620
Are you secretly running on your own?

20:19.130 --> 20:24.220
If you, the team's best, are doing it, then I can't fall behind!

20:24.300 --> 20:25.470
Kunigami.

20:25.550 --> 20:27.430
This is unfair, call me too.

20:27.510 --> 20:28.430
Bachira.

20:28.510 --> 20:30.810
Haven't you noticed yet, Isagi?

20:31.480 --> 20:33.310
Team Z has already

20:34.730 --> 20:37.190
gathered around you.

20:37.270 --> 20:40.110
-I'll never lose to you!
-Me too!

20:40.190 --> 20:43.070
Come on man, I wanted to take a shower!

20:43.150 --> 20:45.740
-We will definitely win tomorrow!
-Let's go!

20:45.820 --> 20:47.410
I'll become the best in the world!

20:47.490 --> 20:50.080
I won't let you keep staying above me!

20:50.950 --> 20:51.950
<i>You guys...</i>

20:54.540 --> 20:58.460
<i>Until recently, no one gave a damn about me.</i>

20:59.590 --> 21:03.590
<i>While I thought my soccer career would end in tears,</i>

21:05.050 --> 21:07.430
<i>now everyone has gathered around me!</i>

21:11.930 --> 21:13.390
<i>I am number one.</i>

21:14.270 --> 21:17.310
<i>I can be reborn here.</i>

21:18.230 --> 21:23.280
<i>Being overtaken by someone weaker than you fires you up.</i>

21:23.990 --> 21:27.700
<i>The presence of an exceptional player can ignite a battle.</i>

21:28.530 --> 21:30.620
<i>This is Blue Lock.</i>

21:32.840 --> 21:35.640
<i>Outside of here, the place where soccer is most intense in the world,</i>

21:36.540 --> 21:39.830
<i>the world's best striker cannot be born.</i>

23:10.800 --> 23:13.430
<i>Blue Lock, Extra Time.</i>

23:14.680 --> 23:17.770
I'll take this! And this! And this too!

23:17.850 --> 23:20.690
They're all Blue Lock exclusive products.

23:20.770 --> 23:25.150
Let's write our names on our toothbrushes so they don't get mixed up.

23:25.230 --> 23:27.110
-Okay!
-Understood.

23:28.030 --> 23:30.400
IEMON OKUHITO

23:32.240 --> 23:37.660
<i>Handwriting is a mirror that reflects a person's heart.</i>

23:37.750 --> 23:39.120
IEMON OKUHITO

23:41.080 --> 23:42.080
Done.

23:42.580 --> 23:44.840
Look, look! This is mine!

23:44.920 --> 23:46.550
With dolphin stickers!

23:48.090 --> 23:53.220
The one that says 'MINE' is mine! If you mix them up, I'll kill you!

23:53.890 --> 23:55.760
Gagamaru's handwriting is terrible!

23:56.350 --> 23:59.270
Are you serious, man? Is this the first time in your life you've written a letter?

24:02.480 --> 24:07.230
<i>Can I really handle these guys?</i>